{"about_the_game":"Breath is not an easy game, but it is not a long game too. <br><br>Start as a simple life-form and evolve your way by defeating the bosses in any order you wish. One ability gained from one boss can help you to defeat another one.<br><br>Can you beat the game without deaths? How fast can you beat it? Try yourself in &quot;<i>1 Life Mode</i>&quot; and &quot;<i>SpeedRun Mode</i>&quot;! Compete against your own time or set a custom time to try to be the fastest in the world!<br><br>Play multiple times trying different routes and, as you play, unlock new abilities to start the game with, adding layers of complexity.<br><br>Don't forget to try to find all the hidden spider webs.<br><br>If you ever feel lost on how to play, pause the game (esc or start) and a button map will show up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Life is but a Breath!</strong></h2></h2><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"All hail the King!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1475350/01e72b24078eb89e6bf404b35430407bea7dd127.jpg"},{"name":"You are amazing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1475350/bf6b408ee57bf437fac026833a6fb54816a5304f.jpg"},{"name":"That was fast!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1475350/a34a6df163727289e25b15e929bcf2ab2aa63f91.jpg"},{"name":"Web Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1475350/a28f85d3e228ca0e4731caf4ea970ebc5e06a131.jpg"},{"name":"First Kill: Wall hugger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1475350/cf40be2e55400724963bbb780e5f5b28f20115b0.jpg"},{"name":"First Kill: Eletric guy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1475350/25c56dc16c6fdc42c6b1e63628e116f20f1ddcd8.jpg"},{"name":"First Kill: Screamer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images